Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.61,0:00:09.03,Sign,,0,0,0,,{\fade(800,600)\shad3\blur1\fs60\c&HF1F1F1&}Episode 10 \N {\fs100} The Story of the Stars {星の話の巻}
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:03.00,Sign,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 10,0:00:17.59,0:00:22.94,Narrator,,0,0,0,,Well, the stars today \Nshine like jewels in the dark of the cosmos.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:24.22,0:00:29.52,Narrator,,0,0,0,,You probably think there are no living creatures on those stars.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:30.27,0:00:33.79,Narrator,,0,0,0,,And if there are those among you
Dialogue: 10,0:00:33.79,0:00:38.86,Narrator,,0,0,0,,who think that a woman who is as pretty \Nas a star might be waiting for you,
Dialogue: 10,0:00:38.86,0:00:43.01,Narrator,,0,0,0,,we'll tell the story of a fine Hermit Village maiden
Dialogue: 10,0:00:43.01,0:00:48.64,Narrator,,0,0,0,,longing for a wonderful man she thought she'd seen in the world of the stars.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:49.91,0:00:51.37,Narrator,,0,0,0,,However...
Dialogue: 10,0:01:27.28,0:01:30.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, my! It's a swan!
Dialogue: 10,0:01:47.14,0:01:48.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh?
Dialogue: 10,0:01:48.85,0:01:50.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh?
Dialogue: 10,0:01:50.16,0:01:52.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I am the Messenger Star. {??????? probably 使い星 but google gives me this weird translation and it's strangely fitting so eh} {使い星 really turns up nothing, but the 使い part is usually to indicate servitude or those in a mission/errand}
Dialogue: 10,0:02:03.49,0:02:05.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh!
Dialogue: 10,0:02:05.10,0:02:07.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, shall you accompany me \Nto the land of the stars?
Dialogue: 10,0:02:07.86,0:02:10.04,Default,,0,0,0,,There's a man waiting for you in the stars.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:10.79,0:02:12.26,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 10,0:02:12.70,0:02:14.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, you starry prick! {calling him stardust, think it's meant as an insult}
Dialogue: 10,0:02:17.13,0:02:18.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Take this!
Dialogue: 10,0:02:31.06,0:02:32.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, let's go.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:32.41,0:02:33.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes...
Dialogue: 10,0:02:51.08,0:02:55.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh? All these stars came to give me a welcome?
Dialogue: 10,0:03:07.84,0:03:10.26,Default,,0,0,0,,My, it's Saturn!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:13.60,0:03:15.14,Default,,0,0,0,,What's this?
Dialogue: 10,0:03:15.14,0:03:17.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Space trash{塵}, left behind by the aliens.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:17.83,0:03:22.07,Default,,0,0,0,,No... I can't meet a man looking like this. Hey...
Dialogue: 10,0:03:22.07,0:03:25.39,Default,,0,0,0,,It's okay. You can wash yourself \Nin the Milky Way, up ahead.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:26.36,0:03:30.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow, it's beautiful!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:40.54,0:03:43.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm in heaven...
Dialogue: 10,0:03:58.86,0:04:01.16,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 10,0:04:01.16,0:04:02.90,Default,,0,0,0,,It tickles!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:08.01,0:04:10.30,Default,,0,0,0,,That was refreshing...
Dialogue: 10,0:04:10.30,0:04:14.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, is it still a long way to the star man?
Dialogue: 10,0:04:14.34,0:04:16.08,Default,,0,0,0,,We're almost there.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:25.63,0:04:27.05,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 10,0:04:32.55,0:04:35.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Now she's totally gone{she's -> she has -> present perfect} \Nsomewhere I can never reach her.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:37.53,0:04:39.12,Default,,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 10,0:04:39.12,0:04:41.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to bring her back from the Wink Star. {no clue if it's a proepr name or something else}{specific place, so most likely proper}
Dialogue: 10,0:04:41.48,0:04:42.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's see...
Dialogue: 10,0:04:46.61,0:04:50.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I see it! Suspicious smoke... Oh?
Dialogue: 10,0:04:52.36,0:04:54.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, saury?
Dialogue: 10,0:04:56.86,0:05:00.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh? He finally managed \Nto snatch a woman for me?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:00.64,0:05:02.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, then...
Dialogue: 10,0:05:02.75,0:05:04.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Rejuvenating medicine...
Dialogue: 10,0:05:12.86,0:05:14.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I'm ready.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:15.90,0:05:20.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh! This is serious, it might threaten \Nthe reputation of the whole Hermit Village! {????????? no clue what he means by "flower will fall"}{it's not falling, it's about whitering; 花が散る}
Dialogue: 10,0:05:20.74,0:05:23.33,Default,,0,0,0,,You should definitely go there and rescue her.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:23.81,0:05:27.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Awful, how awful... \NI want to go and help.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:27.08,0:05:28.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Then off you go!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:34.50,0:05:36.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, that's mesmerizing!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:36.47,0:05:38.30,Default,,0,0,0,,My, how lovely...
Dialogue: 10,0:05:41.12,0:05:44.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, won't you play with us a little?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:44.49,0:05:46.73,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you say, handsome?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:46.73,0:05:48.61,Default,,0,0,0,,What, a flirty star now? {??????????? yuusei could be "planet" but this obviously ain't it}{could be a play on 遊女 (prostitute) and 遊星 (planet), with 遊 being "tease/play" and 星 being "star", so I'll call it jerking star based on the "jerk someone's chain" expression meaning to tease}
Dialogue: 10,0:05:49.84,0:05:51.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm here on a mission!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:51.48,0:05:53.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Gosh, what an prideful man! {????????????}{I could only pick on 鼻 and 男, so I'm assuming it's got something to do with 鼻が高い meaning "proud"}
Dialogue: 10,0:05:53.11,0:05:54.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Young men really are good for nothing.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:54.90,0:05:56.11,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 10,0:06:00.06,0:06:02.24,Default,,0,0,0,,This is dangerous!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:13.66,0:06:19.09,Default,,0,0,0,,You're beautiful, prettier than anyone else \Nin our world of the stars. You're irresistible...
Dialogue: 10,0:06:19.09,0:06:21.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm happy...
Dialogue: 10,0:06:30.92,0:06:32.21,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm happy...
Dialogue: 10,0:06:37.68,0:06:40.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Jewels... Your eyes are like jewels!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:45.31,0:06:49.96,Default,,0,0,0,,It may seem like nothing but stardust, \Nwhen compared to your beauty...
Dialogue: 10,0:06:49.96,0:06:52.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Still, I want to show you something.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:52.63,0:06:53.46,Default,,0,0,0,,This!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:53.46,0:06:55.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, it's lovely!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:56.58,0:06:58.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Delightful!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:23.47,0:07:25.43,Default,,0,0,0,,You're gorgeous.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:25.43,0:07:29.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, please, won't you go \Nto the Hermit Village with me?
Dialogue: 10,0:07:29.48,0:07:31.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, let's go.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:31.33,0:07:32.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Will you?
Dialogue: 10,0:07:32.75,0:07:34.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey...
Dialogue: 10,0:07:34.65,0:07:35.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I cannot.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:36.74,0:07:38.07,Default,,0,0,0,,It is not possible.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:38.07,0:07:39.15,Default,,0,0,0,,No way.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:41.45,0:07:43.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Whew, was I late or did I make it in time?
Dialogue: 10,0:07:43.99,0:07:45.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow, you're beautiful!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:46.33,0:07:49.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go home now,\N don't let that old geezer fool you.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:49.02,0:07:50.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay? Let's go.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:54.75,0:07:58.40,Default,,0,0,0,,You call him a geezer; have you gone crazy?
Dialogue: 10,0:07:58.40,0:08:00.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Or are you just jealous?
Dialogue: 10,0:08:01.11,0:08:04.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Tsk. Just as we were getting to the good part, this yokel appears.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:04.91,0:08:05.84,Default,,0,0,0,,It ticks me off...
Dialogue: 10,0:08:05.84,0:08:09.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, these jewels are blinding you. Right?
Dialogue: 10,0:08:09.01,0:08:11.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Jewels alone can't feed you. {probably means "they're pretty, but you can't put them on the bread"}
Dialogue: 10,0:08:11.50,0:08:12.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Please understand.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:14.23,0:08:15.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Can't feed me?
Dialogue: 10,0:08:15.99,0:08:19.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Come to think of it, I'm a little peckish.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:19.94,0:08:22.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Would you look at that—freshly baked saury!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:22.53,0:08:25.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Enough for your rustic friend too! {????????? nc what's that sankai}
Dialogue: 10,0:08:26.44,0:08:28.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Hm! No processed products at hand, huh?
Dialogue: 10,0:08:29.31,0:08:31.18,Default,,0,0,0,,This is what our civilized society eats.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:31.18,0:08:34.44,Default,,0,0,0,,You can die from eating it unprocessed, got it?
Dialogue: 10,0:08:43.53,0:08:45.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Just go back to being a geezer already!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:46.30,0:08:48.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Crap, I've run out of time.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:51.64,0:08:52.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Come, then!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:52.71,0:08:54.06,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 10,0:08:54.86,0:08:56.96,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 10,0:09:02.74,0:09:03.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Fiddlesticks!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:06.23,0:09:08.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Terrible... How terrible!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:13.04,0:09:14.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll draw some faces for you. {??????}
Dialogue: 10,0:09:18.78,0:09:20.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll give you brooms!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:21.22,0:09:22.40,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 10,0:09:22.40,0:09:23.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Go become comets now!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:30.32,0:09:32.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Comets, huh? I see... {because comet is literally "broom star" because of its trace}{you might want to include that as a TL note}
Dialogue: 10,0:09:37.69,0:09:41.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, I'm sorry, okay? \NI was wrong.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:41.13,0:09:42.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, forgive me.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:42.76,0:09:44.56,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not a big deal, is it?
Dialogue: 10,0:09:44.56,0:09:46.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Please don't look at me so gloomily.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:46.80,0:09:48.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Please...
Dialogue: 10,0:09:49.87,0:09:51.47,Default,,0,0,0,,You only want jewels, don't you? {lit: you're okay with living with jewels}
Dialogue: 10,0:09:51.47,0:09:52.93,Default,,0,0,0,,They're pretty and untalkative.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:52.93,0:09:54.88,Default,,0,0,0,,You really ought to live with them instead.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:55.35,0:09:57.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Farewell, you greedy woman! {?????????????}{can't make it out either}
Dialogue: 10,0:09:59.29,0:09:59.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah...
Dialogue: 10,0:09:59.94,0:10:03.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait... Hey, please wait!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:03.61,0:10:06.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait for me! Come on, please...
Dialogue: 10,0:10:06.20,0:10:08.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey... Hey!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:08.11,0:10:09.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't go!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:09.32,0:10:10.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:11.28,0:10:12.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Why should I?
Dialogue: 10,0:10:12.62,0:10:14.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Alas, reality is nothing like your dreams.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:14.69,0:10:16.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Reality is tough.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:16.55,0:10:17.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey...
Dialogue: 10,0:10:17.79,0:10:18.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:19.23,0:10:20.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait for me!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:20.40,0:10:24.05,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to wait... \NBut no, I can't wait!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:24.05,0:10:24.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Can't wait!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:24.90,0:10:26.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:26.76,0:10:28.07,Default,,0,0,0,,You bully!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:30.37,0:10:31.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Ouch!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:33.91,0:10:36.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh? He fell asleep out here?
Dialogue: 10,0:10:36.70,0:10:41.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Such a slovenly face. Just as I was about to invite him to dinner. Fine, then. {????????}
Dialogue: 10,0:10:41.38,0:10:43.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? So it was a dream?
Dialogue: 10,0:10:44.42,0:10:46.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah! Hey, wait a moment!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:47.39,0:10:49.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, reality is too tough a thing.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:49.82,0:10:51.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Better keep dreaming.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:51.52,0:10:52.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah...
Dialogue: 10,0:10:55.31,0:10:58.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Please... Wait... Wait for me!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:59.39,0:11:01.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait...
Dialogue: 10,0:11:02.32,0:11:04.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Reality is a tough thing!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:09.70,0:11:11.57,Narrator,,0,0,0,,Reality is tough.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:12.53,0:11:17.42,Narrator,,0,0,0,,But if this really happened, \Nthat'd sure be wonderful.
